#. Description of the plugin
#: plugin-settings-finder.php
msgid "Adds an admin bar dropdown that lists every active plugin with direct links to its settings pages, wherever the plugin put them: top level, Settings, Tools, Media, WooCommerce menus, WooCommerce settings tabs and sections, hidden pages."
msgstr ""

